Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:32.71,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Hello...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:36.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin? Were you still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.28,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Uh huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:43.56,sign_943_6_Sold_Out,Red; legible text with Xs by them,0,0,0,,{\frz354.4\fs16\pos(432,147)\frx6\fry344}Sold Out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:43.56,sign_943_6_Sold_Out,Red; legible text with Xs by them,0,0,0,,{\frz354.4\fs16\pos(348,141)\frx18\fry340}Sold Out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:43.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The movie we were thinking of seeing today... \Nit looks like it'll be packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:46.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You want to check out a different one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.81,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I wanna see Angel J.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:59.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Angel J...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:02.83,sign_1435_12_Angel_Jewel_The_,Title card sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&H94509D&\3c&HF3E6C7&\pos(274,81)\frz3.073}Angel Jewel The Movie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:02.83,sign_1435_12_Angel_Jewel_The_,Title card sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HEBEBEB&\3c&HCBA176&\frz353.5\pos(278,132)}The Memorial Diamond
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, it's an anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.97,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's kinda childish, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:08.99,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,It's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:16.52,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Monika-chan is a jewel thief \Nwho wants to become an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.34,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:23.64,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,And she can shoot a laser cutter \Nfrom her left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:24.59,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now I'm kinda interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:29.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why does she want to be an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hang on, I think I'd be \Nembarrassed going to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Any other options?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:41.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I dunno how to interpret \Nthose puppy sounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:45.26,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Ayaka wants to see Angel J...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:50.14,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Pardon me, I think I've got \Nthe wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.23,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ayaka-chan, where's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.29,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Sleeping right next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Could you put her...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:03.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Actually, could you \Ndescribe what she looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:08.06,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:16.22,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Her hair's like the sun. All exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:19.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Exploded? I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:23.08,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Also, her tummy is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.82,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I really... actually, could you cover it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.60,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,So she doesn't get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:33.35,main - italics,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Are you two going out today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:36.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yep, there was a movie she wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:39.09,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I wish I could see Angel J...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't think that was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:48.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You wanna come with us? \NSince I've got you on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:22.98,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Episode 11                       Love Triangle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:27.31,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,Y'know, during summer vacation, \NI secretly got my licen—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:32.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, you dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.99,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got my heart set \Non one girl, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:43.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make eyes \Nat you or Imp-chan anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get serious from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:54.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You realize I was talking about \NSpoiled-chan and the characters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I didn't dump you, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:04:59.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,After all this time, they're a part of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:06.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But it was your birthday, \Nand I wanted you to have a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:14.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I put it on every morning with a grin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Your words and your expression \Nare not matching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:21.71,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I haven't given up, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:27.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you fall \Nwith my acting someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Into hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:38.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Anyway... during summer vacation, \NI got my license in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You wanna go shopping someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I extremely want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You seem different, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:01.93,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Did you forget the face \Nof the girl you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait... Imp-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:07.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are we going to be doing this all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.40,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Who knows if it'll end after only today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You really hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But since I announced my \Nintention to get serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:18.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I won't let you wrap me around your finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:24.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And I'm begging you, please don't \Nmess with me while I'm driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.38,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Let's roll out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:28.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're making me want to \Nsee you act silly, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:40.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If it keeps you safe, I'll act like \Nan absolute buffoon, but not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:50.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:55.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like Kitahama \Nhas scored the first point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:57.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Th-The game has just begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're being awfully quiet, Imp-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.08,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Yeah... I think I'm carsick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:29.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Seriously? Because of my driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're almost there, so open up the window \Nand try to look at something in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.11,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:38.34,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I wanna look at your face \Nwhile you focus on driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:42.10,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Hey, did that make your heart skip a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,...Are you actually carsick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.34,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:54.07,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,She can act even when \Nshe's not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.64,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gotta say, vulnerable Imp-chan \Nis kind of awesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.99,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, is it all acting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:02.86,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't even tell anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.87,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here, we're at the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:17.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, you aren't looking \Nat the water are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:24.14,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,The ocean looks cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:27.52,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is that really Rin sitting \Nbeside me right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.36,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:47.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, it really feels like \Na really feminine space...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.17,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna try this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're leaving me alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:09:00.00,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do \Nwith you when you're so clingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.68,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan's set the pace...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What kind of fashion sense \Ndo you like on a girl, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:12.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't really know fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.87,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,If you bring some clothes \Nyou like, I'll try them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.00,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,You want me to cosplay for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You said I could bring what I like!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.08,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:39.78,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-I put this on so that I could \Nmake you fall for me, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:41.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Tsundere-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You wanted to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:52.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I love how they sell \Nwhole sets of furniture!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:56.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This sofa is super soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.24,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,You're making such a big deal. So childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm serious! Try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:04.00,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,If you insist, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:09.23,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Oh, this really is comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:13.28,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh, I would've figured \NTsundere-chan would be more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.76,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Well... I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:23.77,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-it'd be nice if we could sit \Nhere like this and enjoy drinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:34.52,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-I guess it's strange... me \Nsaying how I really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:39.03,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Th-This was so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:42.92,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,There was no way... I could pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:46.91,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,That was the dere part of the tsundere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.33,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I have to stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:54.46,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Use your head, dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:57.67,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I have to give a clever r-r-response!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.44,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:05.93,sign_15853_131_Multi_Purpose_so,Pricetag sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(260,140)\frz340.7}Multi-Purpose Sofa
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.41,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I don't think we should be \Nsitting here for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Everybody panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:10.94,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(164,345)}Pseudo Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:15.94,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(544,343)}Pseudo Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:22.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Would've been nicer to hit \Nthe beach during the summer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:27.71,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,You die if you get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Should we fight to the death then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.06,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Obviously not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.33,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.38,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:38.05,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,The waves are getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.97,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die! I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:43.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here it comes, here it comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:57.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,W-What're you acting so childish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,W-Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:05.09,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Nobody's dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:08.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you really feeling that competitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:11.24,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-I wouldn't say that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:12.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:33.46,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.67,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,So.. so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:40.02,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,If I catch a cold after this,\N I'm making sure you have it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Should we be bantering when you're soaked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:46.55,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,And... did my bracelet get wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I think it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:55.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I'm more worried about you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.75,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,But what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.64,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:13.22,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,It's not like you gave\N the bracelet to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:17.07,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,But I couldn't bring myself \Nto take it off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:23.10,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,Because... I like you just as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This isn't just acting anymore, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I thought only paying special attention \Nto Rin would show how serious I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:38.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:52.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I love every version of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:59.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I got Senpai to fall for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I might be soaking, \Nbut is it okay if I hug you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You already are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's cold! We're gonna get sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:09.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's what I warned you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:21.99,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I wanna see what it feels like \Nwhen you go really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.64,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Let's cruise Shuto Expressway at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe if you wanna catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:31.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How are you most excited \Nabout going home...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Because I like being able to make you weak \Nin the knees with my acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:39.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, let's drive home \Nat a nice, safe speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:44.08,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I don't want to go home tod—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here, warm up some.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,For the next date, \Nit's Cool-chan's turn, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:01.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're gonna act the entire time again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:05.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe an aquarium or a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:08.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What about a haunted house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:15.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Or maybe we could re-do everything \Nfrom today for Cool-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I have to take every different \Ncharacter through the same date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:22.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That'd mean seeing \Nthe same movie five times, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,...That'd be the hardest for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You realized that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:35.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I have to assume acting \Nall day can't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:40.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I am exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:44.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to take some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:47.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Feel free to sleep on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:50.46,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That seems like such a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:55.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Besides, I feel like I'll really \Ncatch a cold if I fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:09.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Unless you want your body to be Cool-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Now I really am gonna get sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.62,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:30.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've come to pick you up, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.88,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Hup...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ayaka-chan, which way to your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:40.48,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,You can see it over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That is not the kind of distance \Na drive is necessary for, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:50.04,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Put on some music!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:54.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got a song from that anime you like.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.28,sign_24319_209_Track_Name__Ange,HUD Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HBCA7A4&\frz7.442\frx354\fry2\pos(475,131)\b0}Track Name: Angel Heart <3\NArtist: Monika\NAlbum: Anime [Angel Jewel] Best Album
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.28,sign_24319_209_Track_Name__Ange,HUD Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\c&H3A291F&\3c&H3A291F&\4c&H3A291F&\1a&H2D&\frz6.991\pos(225,93)}m 0 0 l 260 0 260 100 0 100
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:07.29,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,When the moon is full, and the stars shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:13.68,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,When my heartstrings are plucked, \Nthere's magic in the night sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:18.55,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Emeralds, looking you in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:23.26,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Feelings, like sapphires, unchanging...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.60,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're here, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:27.80,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Can I sing all the way to the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:29.08,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.81,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, you're spoiling her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:35.84,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I'm sure, we'll get, more. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The stars will rain down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:42.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't hear you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:45.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Singing in front of people is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:47.04,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Even though you sing lots at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:48.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:52.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You'll understand how inadequate \Nyour singing is too, some day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.59,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Moe-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:58.12,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr. Driver, I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:04.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You've got the same blood \Nflowing in your veins too, y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.46,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Bye bye, onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:18.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear you sing someday, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I guess I better practice then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right! Something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:32.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Or maybe we should drive straight \Nto a karaoke place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:33.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:36.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then I can oversee your practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:42.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Too bad, I'm in control \Nof our destination!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm being kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.40,sign_27091_242_Short_Stories_Ab,Flyer sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H534157&\fs14\pos(382,92)\frz29.75}Short Stories\N{\b0\c&H181818&}About Falling In Love
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.40,sign_27091_243_Now_accepting_su,Flyer sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H71497A&\frz29.91\pos(475,184)}Now accepting\Nsubmissions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.39,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A short film about falling in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:56.03,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wanna enter this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:57.57,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna need your help, Eiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:18:59.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,do you have any idea how to make a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.40,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,I've got it covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:07.14,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna direct and \NI've already got all the gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:09.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh, talk about initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:13.03,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,The others from the club \Nhave already agreed to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:16.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So is the only thing left to film it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.92,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,I've got... no ideas for story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, that seems important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.43,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Romance plots, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.92,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Why not get some advice \Nfrom someone in the club?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:30.24,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,I am a writer first, director second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:31.64,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,How would that look?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:34.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Your pride won't stand for it, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.90,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Maybe ask someone \Nwith a girlfriend for input?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:40.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That'd work too, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:46.91,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,I'm not expecting much here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:51.93,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Are there any stories you can tell us about \NNanakura-san that might be good reference?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Very well, let me enlighten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It was a few days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:06.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,when the weather was neither \Nparticularly good or bad, hot or cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:09.73,main,Prez,0,0,0,,So, no, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:10.61,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:14.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You'll need to ask her about \Nthe romantic side of things!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:16.73,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Then put her in touch with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:20.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Tsuu-chan, you don't \Nhave Rin's contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.73,0:20:22.24,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Even though I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:27.88,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Come on, it's embarrassing \Nto ask a girl for that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:30.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And this is the guy who wants \Nto do a romance flick?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.26,sign_29713_275_Discovering_New_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HA34E2F&\3c&HF9F9F9&\frz354\pos(306,210)\b1}Discovering New Stars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:43.76,sign_29803_276_Kitahama_Senpai,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF6F6F6&\fs14\i0\b1\frz356.9\pos(292,93)\frx10\fry344}Kitahama-Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:46.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hello! This is Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:50.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:53.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:59.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Right! I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:01.28,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,You scared me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:07.53,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, I'll let him know you said okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:08.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.05,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,The thing with Tsuu-chan, though... \Nhe's got no cool when it comes to girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:20.05,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Right. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:08.40,main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF3E2E0&\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs22\pos(348,137)}Documentary: Much Ado About Nothing{\c&H2C08BD&} X
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:08.40,main,Narration,0,0,0,,Documentary Much Ado About Nothing X!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.28,sign_Q,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,150)}Q. What do you do \Non your days off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:13.19,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I sleep all the way until noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:17.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So much rest... my head's all loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.95,0:23:20.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That, or my hobby, \Nwhich is playing video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:23.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I play for hours on end... \Nuntil my head's all loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.42,sign_33667_295_What_does_a__sta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(191,264)}What does a \Nstage represent \Nto Kitahama Eiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:31.68,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,Probably seedless grapes that \Nare so good you can eat them, skin included.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.99,0:23:36.19,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,They get rid of the only downside \Nto eating grapes, which was the seeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:38.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's nothing short of revolutionary!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:41.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, peaches! You're shaking \Nin your boots, right?!
